<Base title="About" description="About Cenz.Blog and its knowledge synthesis process." canonicalPath="about/"><div class="prose"><header class="page-header"><p class="eyebrow">About this journal</p><h1>About Cenz.Blog</h1></header><p>Cenz.Blog is a static-first engineering knowledge platform for software, data systems and computational thinking. Each article is published as an independent page that can be read without JavaScript.</p><h2>Distilled knowledge through collaboration</h2><p>Articles start with a practical engineering question. Human direction and AI-assisted research develop the ideas through dialogue, stress testing and review before the material is distilled into a durable reference.</p><h2>Built for the open web</h2><p>Portable source documents become static pages, with Pagefind providing on-demand search. Interactive demonstrations run in isolated frames; no application server is needed.</p></div></Base>
